  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative Support to the Non-IOM affiliated health care provider panel sites providing Pre-Departure Medical Services to refugees on behalf of Immigration, Refugees, and Citizenship Canada</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM provides administrative support to the non-IOM affiliated health care provider providing pre-departure medical services to refugees under the Canadian resettlement program. The support includes facilitation of claim reimbursement, if requested by the Immigration, Refugees, and Citizenship Canada and agreed by IOM.</narrative>
  </description>
